<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Cartoon Character Card</title>

  <style>
    /* Universal Selector - matches success criteria */
    * {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    /* Element Selectors */
    body {
      background-color: #f0f4f8; /* Soft blue-gray background */
    }

    h1 {
      color: #1a365d; /* Dark navy */
    }

    h2 {
      color: #2c5282; /* Slate blue */
    }

    p {
      color: #4a5568; /* Charcoal gray text */
    }

    /* Class Selector - matches success criteria */
    .cartoon-detail {
      color: darkgreen;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    /* ID Selector - styles your specific character box card */
    #cartoon-card {
      background-color: lightcyan; /* Cyan background required by criteria */
      border: 2px dashed #2b6cb0;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>My Cartoon Character Card</h1>

  <p style="color: crimson;">Meet my favorite cartoon character!</p>

  <div id="cartoon-card">
    <h2>About My Character</h2>
    <p class="cartoon-detail">Character Name: SpongeBob SquarePants</p>
    <p class="cartoon-detail">Best Friend: Patrick Star</p>
    <p class="cartoon-detail">Favorite Food: Krabby Patties</p>
    <p class="cartoon-detail">Special Power: Extreme Fry Cooking & Shape-shifting</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Why I Like This Character</h2>
  <p>SpongeBob is incredibly joyful, optimistic, and a loyal friend.</p>
  <p>He always looks on the bright side of things no matter what goes wrong.</p>
  <p>He reminds us to stay creative, laugh every single day, and work hard.</p>

</body>
</html>